# The district's Google Calendar, in iCal format. The calendar page reads it on
# the server and refreshes hourly; without it the page shows the events
# recorded in lib/events.ts with a "Live calendar to come" note.
#
# Google Calendar → Settings → (the district calendar) → Integrate calendar →
# "Secret address in iCal format". The calendar stays private; treat this
# address like a password (Vercel environment variable only, never committed
# or shared). If it leaks, click "Reset" next to it and update the variable.
# Fallback if a Workspace admin has disabled secret addresses: make the
# calendar public and use its "Public address in iCal format" instead.
DISTRICT_CALENDAR_ICS_URL=
